Kragenmoor is a major farming hub in central Morrowind and an ancestral stronghold of House Dres, one of Morrowind's Great Houses. The Dres are an agrarian society whose wealth and influence derive from saltrice plantations and slave labor. And although they are mainly centered around southern Morrowind from the city of Tear, their district extends into central Morrowind via Kragenmoor.  
House Dres are deeply religious, having maintained Daedra worship and ancestral reverence throughout the years, but were firm supporters of the Tribunal Temple. The ancient Dres family crypts in Kragenmoor's mountainside were built by the Chimer when they worshiped the Good Daedra. The ancient Dreloth Clan, a cadet family of House Dres are based in Kragenmoor, having relocated from Vvardenfell where their ancestral tomb remains.{{Ref|name=ONLoadDreloth|Dreloth Ancestral Tomb loading screen text in ESO}}

