Sethiete (also called Seth) is a deity that is worshipped across Tamriel. The nature of Sethiete is unknown, but what is known is his influence. His places of worship are known as the Temples of Sethiete, and one of his temples is a landmark in the city of Camlorn that anchors the main street with the Royal Palace.  
#### Vigryl  
Vigryl (also called Vir Gil) is the God of the Sea worshipped in the Iliac Bay region. People pray to Vigryl to bring them better weather.
}}

Saint Stental slew the demon of Overlook Hill (also called "the Leaper"), rescuing the three Sisters of Kynareth from an untimely death. A statue dedicated to him was built where the demon was slain.  
#### Vitache  
Saint Vitache is the Patron of Millers, Scissor-Grinders, and Bathhouse Attendants. She was honored daily by the millers of Northglen in 2E 582.
}}

Different varieties of Orbs existed, referred to as colored orbs, each granting Meridia's chosen various powers:
-The Blazing Orb, red and linked to fiery passion and intense energy, bestowed fire-related abilities;
-The Phosphorescent Orb, blue and connected to calmness, inevitability, and despair, granted ice-based powers;
-The Scintillating Orb, purple and reminiscent of regality and striking night skies, conferred lightning abilities;
-The Radiant Orb, yellow in hue, enhanced their defenses.
